  "description": "MCP server for listing items on Facebook Marketplace. Bulk-post second-hand listings from folders of photos via Claude. Cross-platform; Kijiji planned.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "mcp",
    "model-context-protocol",
    "facebook-marketplace",
    "kijiji",
